                                                "sense_id": "50e4c78b-4cd9-3f48-81e0-594a34947fe3",
                                                "text": "It may be hard to talk about fauxcest, facial abuse, or the strange sexualization of hamburgers in a Hardee's commercial, but phrases that silence critiques of pornography and pornification spring easily to the lips:[…]"
